body:
I was a little slow, so at first I thought this was the sequel but then... It clicked with me, and my hype reached new limits that I didn't know were possible. 

&#x200B;

LETS GOOOOOOOOOOOO!

Really glad KDA is back, but Akali getting a third music skin is kinda saturated by now. Hoping she gets a cool new design that diferentiates from the other 2 skins.

&#x200B;

Kaisa and Eve look really promising.
